# ─── Research payload directories (Stage B1, 2026-08-25) ────────────────
# NARROW BY DESIGN. Each of these modules holds SOURCE alongside a large
# generated payload, and the split is clean — measured before writing:
#   trend_engine/     287M total; 286M in data/ (264M csv, 18M parquet,
#                     2.2M json). ZERO csv/parquet/json/png outside data/.
#                     Source = 26 .py (0.17M) + 2 .md. Already covered above.
#   canslim_swing/    229M total; 228M in data/ (104M parquet, 66M json).
#                     Source = scripts/ 808K, reports/ 232K, config/ 8K.
#                     config/eps_series_choice.csv (3.6K) is a CHOICE RECORD,
#                     deliberately left visible.
#   pullback_profits/ 18M total; all 18M in data/ (194 parquet). Source =
#                     scripts/ 128K. Zero payload outside data/.
#   research_scratch/ 23M, ALL of it 23 parquet under kundali/. The directory
#                     itself is left un-ignored so future SCRIPTS placed there
#                     stay visible; only the payload subdir is ignored.
# The parent directories are NOT blanket-ignored: doing so would silently
# hide the source that lives beside the payload.
canslim_swing/data/
pullback_profits/data/
research_scratch/kundali/
